    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatal Grounds is a tough 2D precision platformer with a silhouette artstyle. You'll platform your way through 110 levels divided in to 5 chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >110 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant respawns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death counter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave at the start of every level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay showcase:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481470/extras/766e7f5ca1015463499c4dd5f0b29d07.poster.avif?t=1746013915\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481470/extras/766e7f5ca1015463499c4dd5f0b29d07.webm?t=1746013915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481470/extras/766e7f5ca1015463499c4dd5f0b29d07.mp4?t=1746013915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatal Grounds is a tough 2D precision platformer with a silhouette artstyle. You'll platform your way through 110 levels divided in to 5 chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >110 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant respawns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death counter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave at the start of every level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay showcase:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481470/extras/766e7f5ca1015463499c4dd5f0b29d07.poster.avif?t=1746013915\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481470/extras/766e7f5ca1015463499c4dd5f0b29d07.webm?t=1746013915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481470/extras/766e7f5ca1015463499c4dd5f0b29d07.mp4?t=1746013915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
